{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toy Car Race throws you into wild, wacky races where tiny cars zoom, bump, and fly off kitchen tables and living room tracks! It\u2019s fast, chaotic, and ridiculously fun\u2014like your childhood toy box came to life with a need for speed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937600/extras/e93c63548e2d31984244ddd2f37b42b1.poster.avif?t=1772546842\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937600/extras/e93c63548e2d31984244ddd2f37b42b1.webm?t=1772546842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937600/extras/e93c63548e2d31984244ddd2f37b42b1.mp4?t=1772546842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Toy Car Race</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toy Car Race features 3 game modes: Championship, Arcade, and Time Trial, each packed with fast-paced fun. Race across 9 unique tracks filled with twists, jumps, and chaotic turns that keep every lap exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937600/extras/8260b0a9dff87761433328edc9847d79.poster.avif?t=1772546842\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937600/extras/8260b0a9dff87761433328edc9847d79.webm?t=1772546842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937600/extras/8260b0a9dff87761433328edc9847d79.mp4?t=1772546842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p clas